# A2_6 "The Path of the Incarnate": with the lost prophecies, Nibani Maesa
# judges the player after the moons have passed; Sul-Matuul sets the Warrior's
# Test (three tokens from Kogoruhn) and the riddle of the Cavern of the
# Incarnate, whose door opens only at dawn and dusk. Inside waits Moon-and-Star.
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the walks, the console's timescale for
# waiting, and taking each token for looting it; ref FormIDs carry
# Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a2_6_prophecies
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Told of the lost prophecies, she asks the player to return when the moons
# have come and gone; she counts the days herself.
case a2_6_prophecies
run
player->PositionCell 92 180 -150 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt" == 1
talk nibani maesa
ask lost prophecies
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 1
bye
console set timescale to 2000
until 3600 "nibani maesa".localdaysPassed >= 2
console set timescale to 20
talk nibani maesa
ask My judgement
choose 1
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 5
bye
end

# Sul-Matuul names the Warrior's Test.
case a2_6_warrior
run
player->PositionCell 47 380 -185 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt" == 1
talk sul-matuul
ask Third trial
choose 1
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 10
bye
end

# The goblet and corprus weepings in the Dome of Pollock's Eve, the shield in
# the Bleeding Heart.
case a2_6_tokens
run
player->PositionCell 3663 3850 17330 0 "Kogoruhn, Dome of Pollock's Eve"
until 600 GetPCCell "Kogoruhn, Dome of Pollock's Eve" == 1
wait 30
take 052D578B
take 054DE402
run
player->PositionCell -6770 2100 -75 0 "Kogoruhn, Bleeding Heart"
until 600 GetPCCell "Kogoruhn, Bleeding Heart" == 1
wait 30
take 05E39373
until 300 player->GetItemCount shadow_shield == 1
expect player->GetItemCount misc_goblet_dagoth == 1
expect player->GetItemCount ingred_corprus_weepings_01 >= 1
end

# The tokens pass the Warrior's Test; the riddle and the belt follow.
case a2_6_riddle
run
player->PositionCell 47 380 -185 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt" == 1
talk sul-matuul
ask Third trial
choose 1
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 15
expect player->GetItemCount "Malipu_Ataman's_Belt" == 1
bye
end

# The tribe's hunters read the rest of the riddle; the last names the mouth of
# the cave.
case a2_6_hunter
run
player->PositionCell 104 -18 -107 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Shimsun's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Shimsun's Yurt" == 1
talk shimsun
ask eye of the needle
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 20
ask teeth of the wind
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 22
ask skin of the pearl
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 24
bye
end

# The wise woman reads the riddle: the star is the key, the door opens at dawn
# and dusk. "mouth of the cave" (stage 29) is never learned: only Sul-Matuul's
# riddle names it, and OpenMW teaches a topic from text only when the speaker
# has a response to it, which a Champion lacks.
case a2_6_reading
run
player->PositionCell 92 180 -150 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt" == 1
talk nibani maesa
ask the star is the key
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 26
ask the dream is the door
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 28
bye
end

# At dusk the cavern door (its own script) speaks and opens.
case a2_6_door
run
player->Position 52060 109300 6263 0
until 600 GetPCCell "Cavern of the Incarnate" == 0
wait 60
console set timescale to 2000
until 3600 GameHour < 18
until 3600 GameHour > 18.2
console set timescale to 20
activate in_ci_door_01
until 900 GetPCCell "Cavern of the Incarnate" == 1
end

# Taken from Azura's hand, Moon-and-Star wakes the ghosts of the false
# incarnates; Peakstar speaks for them. "Hortator and Nerevarine" (stage 54)
# is never learned, as stage 29 is not: only speakers without a response to
# it (Nibani, Sul-Matuul) ever say it.
case a2_6_ring
wait 60
activate moon_and_star
until 600 GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 50
until 300 MenuMode == 0
expect player->GetItemCount moon_and_star == 1
talk ghost_npc_peakstar
ask Moon-and-Star
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 52
bye
end

# Back at the camp, the wise woman names the Fourth and Fifth trials.
case a2_6_trials
run
player->PositionCell 92 180 -150 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Wise Woman's Yurt" == 1
talk nibani maesa
ask Seven trials
ask Fourth trial
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 60
ask Hortator
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 62
ask Fifth trial
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 64
ask Nerevarine
expect GetJournalIndex A2_6_Incarnate == 66
bye
end
